Name":"亜麻音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54766"},"originalCharacterName":"亜麻音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"625"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having led a sheltered life, Amane is interested in learning about the outside world; the only thing stopping her from doing so being self-doubt. She has a gentle personality, and because she's shy and lacks confidence in herself, Amane can be a little nervous around customers. If the protagonist shows interest in movies, however, she'll follow along the conversation with a smile."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Shirogane Misaki (白金 岬)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54766"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8cac86ba1de85b9b009913fc930fd73d058bfa83a30e7b3bb68bc31308c4a643.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84ed0bd4bc54a021fbedf673fb420992f8016def6270344a4c4b4cb8570e9404.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小清水 亜美","creatorId":"vndb:s622","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s622","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s622","name":"小清水 亜美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48793","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54768","characterName":"みお","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54768"},"originalCharacterName":"みお","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"307"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An aspiring inventor with an already very impressive list of accomplishments under her name. Mio may be very smart, but she contrasts this by instead failing at the most mundane things, like remembering people's names. She claims her inventions are for the good of mankind, but often contradicts this very statement, implying the complete opposite during conversation at times."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Morishita Narumi (森下 成海)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54768"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5900a699c221672ff43215ed85fa4f7ab8143c8473b155a9ad80f1da513e09a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d64aa968a596165e259f2ae45c213b8fc21c022ea44ee0e5e02d4b20a402515.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"喜多村 英梨","creatorId":"vndb:s269","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s269","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s269","name":"喜多村 英梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48791","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54770","characterName":"雪","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54770"},"originalCharacterName":"雪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"809"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"75"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite looking very young, Setsu actually hates being treated like a kid; which is ironic considering she's very immature and spoiled. Costumers and coworkers alike appreciate her youthful charm and little sister type personality, but her innocence is a bit of a double edged sword in the sense that it also makes her prone to being insensitive, being able to mercilessly throw insults at others without realizing the effect her words have on people. Her dream is to become a pastry chef."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Kasuga Yuki (春日 雪)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54770"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/0868d326ad9bb0f8dbf20a2a0765884fd0a5aed781469543d67298dff1246563.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a28ff367a9f6f2132d2c9ec0c93f72dab8c7ff1df0c2dbc42c96f1f0efcd37ce.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水橋 かおり","creatorId":"vndb:s131","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s131","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s131","name":"水橋 かおり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48790","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54771","characterName":"玲香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54771"},"originalCharacterName":"玲香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1130"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aiming to become a professional bowler, Reika's passion to the sport is so strong she spends a large amount of her free time at the bowling alley. She enjoys music and exercise and excelled in both during high school, so she has not only confidence in her singing abilities, but also her stamina for dancing. She's a friendly and energetic big sister type, but a couple of drinks will bring out her forceful side. Being from Osaka, she often worries about her little sister back home."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Akabane Chitose (赤羽ちとせ)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54771"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0f6e950986da7611ac08c9bdcc9c27c64f4c16c7dc47f155c3ff46d2863956e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/217ad0f984125703fd1d7590ae71087b1d39df39637874e4e74d84a09d662396.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"早水 リサ","creatorId":"vndb:s8127","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8127","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8127","name":"早水 リサ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48800","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54772","characterName":"魅杏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54772"},"originalCharacterName":"魅杏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1031"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she's not working as a hostess at night, Mian either follows her dream of modeling or helps her parents at tending the family butcher shop. A very obvious tsundere, she struggles to express her feelings honestly, and although she wants to open up to the people around her, efforts to do so often end in misunderstandings or in Mian reacting angrily to cover up her embarrassment."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Kouenji Hikaru (高円寺 ひかる)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54772"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7feb94576a018eed91cde0fdda94533fb203438ae70b7a6cebfdd0fb240c6849.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4e582c0c244aeda42ab363ac19d8348c41e4253dc91fc60bb27bae1a9b0d2b0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真堂 圭","creatorId":"vndb:s41","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s41","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s41","name":"真堂 圭","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48789","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54773","characterName":"るい","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54773"},"originalCharacterName":"るい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"510"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Keeping her job as a hostess a secret, Rui is actually a teacher at an all boy's school by day; she's loved in both work places for her kind and reliable disposition. She has a very voluptuous figure and her hostess uniform was custom made to emphasize this fact. Although she may seem like the type to flaunt her adult charm, Rui is actually very girly, prone to daydreaming, and is a big fan of anything romantic."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Mejiro Midori (目白 みどり)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54773"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddc987ec7fddc07e3ac1267895a69573e8deb23a6ed0cc8689d10ee03b5ccdea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/9645e12e704f6d1236bcae330a405db45a62d257de51d7ca3d7e06c6dfb3b78e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"原田 ひとみ","creatorId":"vndb:s1116","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1116","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1116","name":"原田 ひとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48795","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54774","characterName":"理保","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54774"},"originalCharacterName":"理保","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1220"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"96"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A recurring character who appeared in a number of D3 games. In this continuity Riho is a gravure idol who has made several appearances in TV dramas and is on the verge of her big break; an upcoming role in a movie. Her character in this big project is a hostess, and in Riho's mind, what better way to get into the character than to experience the job for real? She's cheerful and energetic and ties to take care of her figure, she can give the impression of being an airhead at times, but is actually rather perceptive and good at dodging uncomfortable situations."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her full name is Futaba Riho (双葉 理保)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54774"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/8468422a9f9490bcf8c85f4ad859758d0b5fac226f8d30f2c5a2cace17157d3f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bfbdecbb39fc3cee686d530577d8690cbf12975f458f374bbae7da2fb0af263.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"後藤 邑子","creatorId":"vndb:s833","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s833","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s833","name":"後藤邑子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48794","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54775","characterName":"ナオ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54775"},"originalCharacterName":"ナオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"923"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"76"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cheerful and energetic, Nao is a tomboy personified. Her family owns a dojo specialized in mixed martial arts, and Nao has trained enough to a point she occasionally teaches the classes herself. When she's not working as a hostess or at the dojo, she goes to university, majoring in physical education. Her reason for becoming a hostess is to get more in touch with her feminine side."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Hikawa Minami (氷川 南緒)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54775"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e37e777dc486d641a006a73cfef8789e044b9fe3ca69363114f037b4d49126af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/968e5980ff6a04e9437a1af4a1e995a4c88c3a0b4beba7c3cbd679ae0fbdbbad.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"又吉 愛","creatorId":"vndb:s1646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1646","name":"又吉 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48796","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54776","characterName":"魔璃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54776"},"originalCharacterName":"魔璃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"504"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious woman characterized by her gothic style clothing and signature eyepatch on her left eye. Mari implies having firsthand knowledge related to the occult, often mentioning \"little devils\" and \"fallen angels\" in conversation, and may suspect a person or two of being vampires. When she's not working as a hostess, she's the vocalist of the indie band \"Bloody Marilyn\" along with her older brother."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Edogawa Yuka (江戸川 優香)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54776"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c42ea0191f4326e13d72e864898c144abddb3b618585cbd1c253d215afcd145.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c0b283c1626bd4d788e273b13118fd07e0d5e815f52a7e7943bb5d9b54274e0a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石毛 佐和","creatorId":"vndb:s2222","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2222","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2222","name":"石毛佐和","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48798","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54777","characterName":"アイリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54777"},"originalCharacterName":"アイリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"701"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An android of the \"ROZA TYPE ZERO\" series. Working at Dream Club for the purpose of acquiring emotional data through conversations, some of the intelligence she gathers can end up being slightly strange because of the specific working environment she's in. Airi's sentences often end in question marks, since for her, conversation is for the sake of learning."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is ROZA Type-0-ILI (ROZA零式-ILI)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54777"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f82723d2774ce5b9717f2bbbca1670f6745ee1bdca77adfe712a3e5d69939dd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df49e6297e8689fc1b5e357505c31215e4200382d15a7e4e24e45f1f97dee69b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"児玉 明日美","creatorId":"vndb:s11385","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11385","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11385","name":"児玉明日美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48801","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c76960","characterName":"遙華","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c76960"},"originalCharacterName":"遙華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"127"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sole heiress to the globally acclaimed Mikado Group, Haruka works as a hostess for the sole purpose of learning about society and growing more independent. Being raised as part of the elite of the elite, she can be described as being arrogant, selfish, self-centered, and a little ignorant; claiming to have gained independence from her family and their wealth while simultaneously always being accompanied by two of her bodyguards."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Mikado Sei (御門 聖)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76960"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b16c51aa29f92a0edce58f31493481f318fa98d5601793546b0bff0c0ae0f7d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8df7c79e0ce566f82bc1e461a98a601313c5bb516fbcb07d54fde04c9ddfc90f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"椎名 へきる","creatorId":"vndb:s613","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s613","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s613","name":"椎名 へきる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48792","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c76961","characterName":"あすか","sourceIds":{"vndbCha